## Time-based blind
This technique uses conditional delays in the response time to infer data; if the condition is true, the query sleeps for a noticeable time (e.g., 5 seconds), otherwise it returns quickly.

Base payload to test delay when condition is true:
' AND CASE WHEN (1=1) THEN dbms_pipe.receive_message('x',5) ELSE NULL END=1 --

To find the length of the current user using binary search (same logic as boolean):

